export default [{"n":1,"name":"BTILC 40th Anniversary Gerald Okamura Figure","slug":"btilc-40th-anniversary-gerald-okamura-figure","price":18,"status":"sold-out","created":"2026-06-08","desc":"It's been 40 years since Big Trouble in Little China hot the Screens. Let's celebrate with this awesome mini fig of Gerald Okamura wielding his in his dual golden six shooters. Each figure is hand poured hard resin and stands at just about 3 inches tall. He comes bagged and carded with art by the one and only @wtedesign.\n\nI do my best to avoid defects, but they are hand made. They are hard resin, so if you drop them from high enough, he may lose a gun barrel (I stupidly chucked one at the ground to test this out).\n\nAnywhoo... I don't have many, so if you want one and don't get one, I'll make some more asap - my mold went to shit so I have to make a new one. They are really great in hand and a really fun take on the Legendary Gerald Okamura.","opts":[{"name":"Rotofugi Blue Man or Many Weapons","sold":true},{"name":"UV Reactive Rainbow Man or Many Weapons","sold":true},{"name":"Clear as Ice Man or Many Weapons","sold":true},{"name":"Green Slime Man or Many Weapons","sold":true},{"name":"Bloody Nightmare Man or Many Weapons","sold":true},{"name":"Ice Blue Man or Many Weapons","sold":true}],"files":["img/001-1.webp","img/001-2.webp","img/001-3.webp","img/001-4.webp","img/001-5.webp","img/001-6.webp","img/001-7.webp","img/001-8.webp"]},{"n":2,"name":"Speclatron NKE6.0 Mutant","slug":"speclatron-nke60-mutant","price":50,"status":"sold-out","created":"2026-06-08","desc":"This is a full size, solid resin beast with glittery flakes cast within. He's a 1 of 1 and comes in a biohazard bag because you know, he's a mutant.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/002-1.webp","img/002-2.webp","img/002-3.webp"]},{"n":3,"name":"Keshi Cheese Goblin","slug":"keshi-cheese-goblin","price":28,"status":"sold-out","created":"2024-08-01","desc":"Goblins? Goblins you say??? This ain't no ordinary Goblin. This is the second cousin of the Cheddar Goblin that you may have seen in Mandy. Or, you may have seen this dude in a McDonald's happy meal... Anyway... \r\n\r\nHERE HE IS - THE AMERICAN CHEESE GOBLIN!!! He is made from semi-rigid urethane (task-16. He stands on his own and has some flex but no jiggle.  Just how you like it. Chonky af and he knows it. \r\n\r\nEach comes bagged with a gorgeous gigantic header card. \r\n\r\nHe is a lovingly hand cast bootleg by yours truly. All art done by the amazing @wtedesign. ","opts":[{"name":"A - 1 OF 1 SUPER CRAZY MULTI COLOR GID GOBLIN","sold":true},{"name":"B - BOOGER GOBLIN","sold":false},{"name":"C - RED GOBLIN","sold":false},{"name":"D - BOOGER GOBLIN","sold":true}],"files":["img/003-1.webp","img/003-2.webp"]},{"n":4,"name":"Return of the Kung Fu Claw!","slug":"return-of-the-kungfu-claw","price":22,"status":"sold-out","created":"2024-08-01","desc":"I am super excited and proud to bring back this killer collab between @officialgeraldokamura (hand model), @nopal62 (original artwork) @worst_toy_ever_design (packaging) @simian_cheese (print/mold/cast/packaging) and NoGoodName(3D sculptor).\r\n\r\nTHE KUNG FU CLAW stands just under 3 inches and is made of keshi-like rubber. They are hand cast by the Cheese Master in marbled day-glo uv colors and some gid stuff.\r\n\r\nEach comes on a blister card designed by the one and only @worst_toy_ever_design.","opts":[{"name":"A - PINK / PURPLE UV MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"B - BLUE UV AND BLACK MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"C - BLUE UV / GREEN UV MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"D - BLUE UV / GREEN UV MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"E - UV YELLOW / BLACK MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"F - GREEN UV / BLACK MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"G - BLUE UV / RED UV MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"H- GLOW UV / BLACK MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"I - BLUE / YELLOW MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"J - UV PINK / BLACK MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"K - GLOW ORANGE / BLACK MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"L - UV PINK / BLACK MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"M - UV RED / BLACK MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"N - UV YELLOW / UV BLUE / UV GREEN MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"O - UV YELLOW / UV RED MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"P - UV RED / UV PRUPLE MARBLED","sold":true},{"name":"Q - BOOGER GREEN DOES NOT STAND VERY WELL ","sold":false},{"name":"R - GLOW GREEN / GLOW ORANGE ","sold":true},{"name":"S - UV ORANGE","sold":false},{"name":"Z - UV RED / BLACK MARBLED","sold":true}],"files":["img/004-1.webp","img/004-2.webp","img/004-3.webp","img/004-4.webp","img/004-5.webp","img/004-6.webp","img/004-7.webp"]},{"n":5,"name":"Simian Cheese's American Cheese Goblin","slug":"american-cheese-goblin","price":25,"status":"sold-out","created":"2024-05-06","desc":"Goblins? Goblins you say??? This ain't no ordinary Goblin. This is the second cousin of the Cheddar Goblin that you may have seen in Mandy. Or, you may have seen this dude in a McDonald's happy meal... Anyway... \r\n\r\nHERE HE IS - THE AMERICAN CHEESE GOBLIN!!! He is made from super jiggly rubber (smooth-on EcoFlex near clear 45) and feels heavy and fleshy, just how you like it. Chonky af and he knows it. He will jiggle as long as you can shake him, don't even try to stop him. \r\n\r\nEach comes bagged with a gorgeous gigantic header card. \r\n\r\nHe is a lovingly hand cast bootleg by yours truly. All art done by the amazing @wtedesign. ","opts":[{"name":"GOBLIN 1 - Mr. Jiggle Flesh","sold":true},{"name":"GOBLIN 2 - Mr. Gimp","sold":true},{"name":"GOBLIN 3 - Mr. Fleshy McFleshFlesh","sold":true},{"name":"GOBLIN 4 - Mr. Clear Eyes","sold":true},{"name":"GOBLIN 5 - Mr. Cheddar","sold":true},{"name":"GOBLIN 6 - Mr. Even Cheddarier","sold":true},{"name":"GOBLIN 7 - Mr. Fleshy Pants","sold":true},{"name":"GOBLIN 8 - Mr. Disco Gimp - Black Glitter","sold":true},{"name":"GOBLIN 9 - Mr. Green Goblin","sold":true},{"name":"GOBLIN 10 - Mr. Lighter Green ","sold":true},{"name":"GOBLIN 11 - SEE PIC!! - Mr. Clipped Ear ","sold":true},{"name":"GOBLIN 12 - Da' Boogs","sold":true}],"files":["img/005-1.webp","img/005-2.webp","img/005-3.webp","img/005-4.webp","img/005-5.webp","img/005-6.webp","img/005-7.webp","img/005-8.webp","img/005-9.webp","img/005-10.webp","img/005-11.webp","img/005-12.webp","img/005-13.webp"]},{"n":6,"name":"Faker HE.-T. (Blue)","slug":"faker-he-t-blue","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2023-11-25","desc":"What would happen if E.T. and He-Man had a baby? Probably not this, but it's not likely to happen anyway. \r\n\r\nYou will get one Faker Blue HE.-T. that will blow your mind. If you can't handle having your mind blown, please don't buy one. I think some of these may even glow with the Power. \r\n\r\nAll are bagged and come with an insanely cool diorama - Basically, you unfold and flip the header card and voila' HE.-T. is now way more playable. He's a great desk idol or stocking stuffer. Go nuts.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/006-1.webp","img/006-2.webp","img/006-3.webp"]},{"n":7,"name":"Random Metal(lic) HE.-T. ","slug":"metal-lic-he-t","price":17,"status":"sold-out","created":"2023-11-25","desc":"What would happen if E.T. and He-Man had a baby? Probably not this, but it's not likely to happen anyway. \r\n\r\nYou will get one random Mettalic HE.-T. that will blow your mind. If you can't handle having your mind blown, please don't buy one. I think some of these may even glow with the Power. \r\n\r\nThese aren't painted, it's a metallic powder that goes into the mold and becomes one with the figure. It's super reflective, hypnotically pleasing and a treat to your senses. \r\n\r\nAll are bagged and come with an insanely cool diorama - Basically, you unfold and flip the header card and voila' HE.-T. is now way more playable. He's a great desk idol or stocking stuffer. Go nuts.\r\n\r\nIf you have a preference to specific one, lemme know and I will try to accommodate you. You are awesome.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/007-1.webp","img/007-2.webp","img/007-3.webp","img/007-4.webp","img/007-5.webp"]},{"n":8,"name":"Pazuzu In MY Pocket - Random Color","slug":"pazuzu-in-my-pocket","price":9,"status":"sold-out","created":"2023-11-25","desc":"Is that a Pazuzu In Your Pocket, or are you just happy to see me? Ha... ha.. ha.. yeah...\r\nThis is a bootleg of a toob toy that you can get on amazon for pennies, but they're grey and kinda suck. These are way better and why they cost a million times more. Each one is hand poured, pigmented, etc. Some are metallic, some are clear, some glow, some are just cool in general. Each comes bagged and carded. You can mention what you like in the order comments and I will do my best to accomodate.\r\n\r\nAwesome card art by @wtedesign","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/008-1.webp","img/008-2.webp","img/008-3.webp","img/008-4.webp","img/008-5.webp"]},{"n":9,"name":"The Man of Many Weapons","slug":"the-man-of-many-weapons","price":28,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-02-06","desc":"Simian Cheese is proud to bring you The Man of Many Weapons! For almost 70 years, Gerald Okamura has been kicking ass. He has spent his life creating and mastering weaponry of every kind imaginable. With 39 feature films under his belt and still crushing heads today he is truly LEGEND.\r\n\r\nThis amazing homage to Gerald is beautifully sculpted by @therojotoy and cast by myself. He comes with six interchangeable arms which each carry a unique death machine. The man himself is cast in semi-rigid urethane rubber (task-16) and the arms as cast in rigid resin (325). The arms plug into four holes in the Masters back and reach around to kick-ass. It is a bit of a balancing act to get him to stand with the assortment of arms, but it's kinda fun.\r\n\r\nThe amazing card art by @worsttoyeverdesign doubles as a weapons rack to hold the unused weaponry.\r\n\r\nThe Man stands at 2 inches tall.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/009-1.webp","img/009-2.webp","img/009-3.webp","img/009-4.webp","img/009-5.webp"]},{"n":10,"name":"I am Nugget hat. Make a statement. ","slug":"i-am-nugget-hat","price":15,"status":"active","created":"2022-10-29","desc":"Make a statement by wearing this hat. What that statement is.... Hmmm.... maybe you are an adult film star? Maybe you wanna proudly represent the mustache crowd. Maybe you are just fried? I dunno... You know people are going to ask, so have something ready.... just sayin'\n\nThese are awesome. All made by local talent in my town. They are super high quality hats with kick-ass professional embroidery on them.\n\nThis ship in boxes so that they won't get smushed.\n\n**** International folks, shoot me a DM @simian_cheese on IM and we can figure out shipping. **** \n\nEach comes with a holographic sticker of authenticity to ensure that it is authentic, which it is. Sticker designed by @wtedesign\n\nSpecs:\nDistrict ® Super Soft Mesh Back Cap\nFabric: 100% cotton twill front panels, 100% polyester mesh mid and back panels\nStructure: Unstructured\nProfile: Low\nClosure: 7-position adjustable snap","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/010-1.webp","img/010-2.webp","img/010-3.webp"]},{"n":11,"name":"Simian Cheese's Paint by Nuggets: Hopalong Nuggity","slug":"simian-cheese-s-paint-by-numbers-hopalong-nuggity","price":20,"status":"sold-out","created":"2022-11-02","desc":"Why did I do this? Hmmmm that's a very good question... I thought it was a good idea... is that enough? haha I've always liked paint by numbers by always hated the content. Kittens, puppies, landscapes... I'm not hating on kittens, puppies nor landscapes, I just don't want to paint them. \r\n\r\nSo to make a long story longer, I made these. \r\n\r\nThey're totally hand made and I have never done anything like this before. The 'canvas' is a museum quality 100% acid-free 246lb paper. Wha huh? That means that it is really good quality and cost me a pretty penny. I mixed the paint colors (15 of them) as best as I could, if they're not good enough, please mix your own - switch color palettes, flock it, add some neon, do what you do. \r\n\r\nThey come with a little brush and a bigger brush. They should be good enough. If not, you know the drill....\r\n\r\n1 of 9.25 inch X 12 inch premium art board\r\n1 color printout of how good it could be\r\n1 very legible color key thing so that you can read all of the teeny numbers\r\n1 kind small brush\r\n1 slightly larger brush\r\n15 pots of paint that kinda match the palette see in the printout\r\n1 pot of pearly shite paint, go nuts\r\n1 pot of black pain. Just because.\r\n\r\n**** International folks, shoot me a DM @simian_cheese on IM and we can figure out shipping. **** \r\n\r\nI also did a Frankenstein one but am not going to fill any more paint pots any time soon. If you're interested, let me know on IG @simian_cheese ","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/011-1.webp","img/011-2.webp","img/011-3.webp","img/011-4.webp"]},{"n":12,"name":"A couple of Random HE.-T.","slug":"random-he-t","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2023-11-25","desc":"What would happen if E.T. and He-Man had a baby? Probably not this, but it's not likely to happen anyway. \r\n\r\nThese are a couple of random ones - one is black and the other a clear blue.\r\n\r\nAll are bagged and come with an insanely cool diorama - Basically, you unfold and flip the header card and voila' HE.-T. is now way more playable. He's a great desk idol or stocking stuffer. Go nuts.","opts":[{"name":"Obsidian Black HE.-T.","sold":true},{"name":"Clear Ice Blue HE.-T.","sold":true}],"files":["img/012-1.webp","img/012-2.webp"]},{"n":13,"name":"ECTO STICKERS","slug":"ecto-stickers","price":1.99,"status":"sold-out","created":"2022-04-08","desc":"Worst Toy Ever Designs and Simian Cheese are proud to bring you ECTO STICKERS. 8 kiss cut vinyl stickers packed into one ecto containment unit. These stickers are YOUR proof of a ghostly encounter!!!","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/013-1.webp"]},{"n":14,"name":"WTESC - Mighty Max Head Sticker Sheet","slug":"mighty-max-head-sticker-sheet","price":1.99,"status":"sold-out","created":"2022-04-02","desc":"Well, these are cool. 9 little Mighty Max Horror Heads stylized and lovingly placed on a sticker sheet by @wtedesign. One is missing his ears... no one is perfect. You should get these and stick them all over the place, they will make you happy. \r\n\r\nSticker design by the one and only Worst Toy Ever Design @wtedesign ","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/014-1.webp"]},{"n":15,"name":"The Boy in the Plastic Clamshell","slug":"the-boy-in-the-plastic-clamshell","price":20,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-04-05","desc":"This is a purely selfish project. I used to watch this movie with my mom when I was a wee little one. Such a strange movie and one of Johnny Travolta's first. This Sweathog has been meticulously hand booted and hand painted (non-flesh version) by the Cheese Master himself. He comes in a plastic clamshell to protect him from the evils of the outside world. \r\n\r\nThe graphics were once again designed by the amazing @worst_toy_ever_design","opts":[{"name":"Unpainted Flesh","sold":true},{"name":"Hand Painted","sold":false}],"files":["img/015-1.webp","img/015-2.webp","img/015-3.webp","img/015-4.webp","img/015-5.webp"]},{"n":16,"name":"Okamura Punch - The drink with a kick!","slug":"okamura-punch-the-drink-with-a-kick","price":25,"status":"sold-out","created":"2023-05-08","desc":"Made of super elastic and spastic rubber that stretches, bends, smooshes and can take a beating - just like The Legend himself Gerald Okamura. \r\n\r\nThey don't stand well, they're meant to be smooshed. Some of them, you can kinda suction them onto a flat surface, but not all. This is another tough material to work with - just sayin'\r\n\r\nVarious colors available, use the pulldown thing and look at pic. They are all awesome.","opts":[{"name":"A - Banana  Jamma","sold":true},{"name":"B - Fleshy Mc Flesh Flesh","sold":true},{"name":"C - UV Purple Nurple","sold":true},{"name":"D - UV Orange (nothing rhymes with orange)","sold":false},{"name":"E - Weird Glow in the Dark Green","sold":true},{"name":"F - Boston Baked Bean ","sold":false},{"name":"G - Light Blue for You","sold":true}],"files":["img/016-1.webp","img/016-2.webp","img/016-3.webp","img/016-4.webp","img/016-5.webp"]},{"n":17,"name":"Simian Cheese's GOLDENBALLS - Foamy Sophia","slug":"foamy-sophia","price":60,"status":"sold-out","created":"2023-05-08","desc":"She so foamy.\r\nMade in the likeness of the greatest Golden Girl of them all, Sophia. She's sassy, she's snarky, she's cynical as hell - and now, she's FOAMY! Yes... she's made from slow rise foam!! \r\n\r\nThere's one that I refer to as a 'paint test' - it's cheaper. It's an early prototype that I tried a different paint treatment on the eyes.\r\n\r\nI also have some imperfect blanks for cheap. These have bubbles, gaps, voids inside and are not painted. If you just want something to be weird with, this is your cheap option to do so.\r\n\r\nAll hand made and hand painted with graphics by the almighty @worsttoyeverdesigns. \r\n\r\n ","opts":[{"name":"Foamy Sophia","sold":true},{"name":"Foamy Sophia Paint test","sold":true},{"name":"Weird Imperfect Blanks - read description","sold":true}],"files":["img/017-1.webp","img/017-2.webp","img/017-3.webp","img/017-4.webp","img/017-5.webp"]},{"n":18,"name":"The Legend Punch Dispenser","slug":"the-legend-punch-dispenser","price":35,"status":"sold-out","created":"2023-05-08","desc":"Each is a fully functional punch dispenser made in the likeness of The Legend himself @officialgeraldokamura. I carved the crap out of a solid resin head by @mondaytoyclub, gutted a pez for it's functional innards, married the two with apoxy, molded, cast, painted, assembled, whew! Then sculpted a little fist that fits inside the punch dispenser, molded, cast in fabulous colors (some bloody flesh, some glow). Each will come with six or so of fists and three packs of delicious pez candy. Don't eat the fists unless you like broken teeth. Then blisters... Cleaning blisters, printing and cutting stickers, cutting thick ass board, sticking stickers to said board, punching board and then finally taping the blister down and..... done! Easy peasy lemon squeezey.\r\n\r\n**** For the first time, I am offering up my prototype/master on this one. It's the actual one that I carved up, combined with Pez parts and then made my mold from. He'll come carded as well, but he's special because he's one of one. Oh, and he'll come with my original 'sculpt' for the fist - that's one of one too ;) ***\r\n\r\nOnce again thanks to @wtedesign for the awesome card art, I can't do it without him.","opts":[{"name":"Punch Dispenser","sold":true},{"name":"Prototype / Master Punch Dispenser ","sold":false}],"files":["img/018-1.webp","img/018-2.webp","img/018-3.webp","img/018-4.webp"]},{"n":19,"name":"Simian Cheese's Nugget Buddies","slug":"simian-cheese-s-nugget-buddies","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2022-11-02","desc":"Have you ever wanted to snuggle with your McNuggets and just found it not so satisfying? Don't worry, you aren't weird, you aren't alone. Well, maybe you are all of that, but anyway... The little Nugget Buddies need homes. They are doing the best that they can, but they need love and lots of it. They are super easy to take care of, but the basic cute furry monster rules apply: 1) Don't get wet 2) Don't expose to bright lights 3) Don't feed after midnight. They aren't much trouble unless you break any one of those rules... then you're f*cked. \r\n\r\nThese are all very hand made by very talented people in my town. No factories, no sweatshops, no child labor. Actually, I did put my kids to work on these, so there.\r\n\r\nThey are roughly twice the size of a McNugget. They are made of super soft, super elegant furry goodness and stuffed with super luxurious, silky stuffing. \r\n\r\nEach is very hand made and no two will ever be alike. You can push the bottoms in (oh baby) and make them stand, which is awesome.\r\n\r\nYou should really adopt two, maybe they're unrelated, will fall in love any make baby Nugget buddies - wouldn't that be something? Let's just hope that they are truly unrelated... which is unlikely.\r\n\r\n**** International folks, shoot me a DM @simian_cheese on IM and we can figure out shipping. **** \r\n\r\nThe packaging is designed by my counterpart in crime @wtedesign","opts":[{"name":"Sweetie Pie Nugget Buddy","sold":true},{"name":"Mr. Mustachio Nugget buddy","sold":false}],"files":["img/019-1.webp","img/019-2.webp","img/019-3.webp","img/019-4.webp","img/019-5.webp"]},{"n":20,"name":"Simian Cheese's Monster Mess","slug":"simian-cheese-s-monster-mess","price":17,"status":"sold-out","created":"2022-04-02","desc":"This is a collection of a few of my favorite weirdos. They are all different colors, most light up under UV or glow in the dark of night. Some don't. You won't know until you open them at a disco or in your closet.\r\n\r\nEach blind bag (just keep reading) will have AT LEAST 4 of the 6 different figures. They're all bootlegs, a couple have been shrunk like crazy, if they're clear and colorless, they likely glow. They're all super fun and will make great desk haunts. \r\n\r\nAs always, kick-ass monster header card by the one and only Worst Toy Ever Design @wtedesign ","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/020-1.webp","img/020-2.webp","img/020-3.webp","img/020-4.webp","img/020-5.webp"]},{"n":21,"name":"One Spin of the Simian T Mystery Machine","slug":"one-spin-of-the-simian-t-mystery-machine","price":8,"status":"sold-out","created":"2022-07-31","desc":"THE SPINNING WILL HAPPEN LIVE on IG (@simian_cheese) ON WEDS AUG 3 at 8:30PM Eastern time. See you then!! Woohoo!  https://www.instagram.com/simian_cheese/\r\n\r\n$8 gets you one spin. One spin guarantees you one Simian T head.  The machine is full of a random assortment of keshi and hard rubber Ts. Some glow, some change color in the sun, some change color in heat, some are clear, some are not, some bounce others clank, some light up under black light, some do nothing. \r\n\r\nSOMEONE WILL GET THE GOLDEN T!!! Whoever this is will win a random pile of Simian goods. I am not sure what it is yet, but you won't be disappointed. And if you are, you can try to sell them on eBay where you will be disappointed. ","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/021-1.webp","img/021-2.webp","img/021-3.webp"]},{"n":22,"name":"One Spin of the Mc-E-D's Machine","slug":"one-spin-of-the-mc-e-d-s-machine","price":8,"status":"sold-out","created":"2022-07-31","desc":"THE SPINNING WILL HAPPEN LIVE on IG (@simian_cheese) ON WEDS AUG 3 at 8:30PM Eastern time. See you then!! Woohoo!  https://www.instagram.com/simian_cheese/\r\n\r\nOne spin guarantees you  one of the following:\r\n1 keshi nugget topper\r\nor\r\n1 keshi or hard resin Mayor McCheese (a couple of the keshi ones don't stand. If that's a deal breaker, let me know in your order comments)\r\nor\r\n3 mini nuggets in random colors and either hard resin or keshi\r\n\r\nI have some scumbags to throw in with random orders as well. Lucky you.\r\n\r\nAs with most things, some glow, some light up under black light, some change color in heat, some change color in the sun, some bounce, others don't. \r\n","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/022-1.webp","img/022-2.webp","img/022-3.webp","img/022-4.webp","img/022-5.webp"]},{"n":23,"name":"The Scumbag","slug":"the-scumbag","price":11,"status":"sold-out","created":"2022-04-02","desc":"Why is he a Scumbag? I dunno.. he just looks kinda gnarly. I am sure he has a better rep in the universe where he originated, but here, he's a scumbag. They all various flavors of scum. The top half of the pic is daylight, the bottom under UV. A few also GID. Pick a number and pick a scumbag! He's hard resin and hand cast.\r\n\r\nAs always, kick-ass Scumbag header card by the one and only Worst Toy Ever Design @wtedesign ","opts":[{"name":"1","sold":true},{"name":"2","sold":true},{"name":"3","sold":true},{"name":"4","sold":true},{"name":"5","sold":true},{"name":"6","sold":false},{"name":"7","sold":false},{"name":"8","sold":true},{"name":"9","sold":true},{"name":"10","sold":true},{"name":"11","sold":true},{"name":"12","sold":true},{"name":"13","sold":true}],"files":["img/023-1.webp","img/023-2.webp","img/023-3.webp"]},{"n":24,"name":"Return of the Crypt Creeper's Return","slug":"return-of-the-crypt-creeper-s-return","price":16.66,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-11-06","desc":"A few people hit me up to make a few more of these, so here they are.  These are likely the last ones. \r\n\r\n-------------------------------\r\n\r\nYou asked, so he's back. The Crypt Creeper returns. He's a 100% bootleg freak from the board game, but I have made him better. That's the whole point of bootlegging right? Anyway... Most of these little dudes are double pour (meaning that they have basically been cast twice - two resin batches, twice in the pressure pot). Their fleshless faces glow like the sun (green/blue more than red/orange) in the dark and some even glow more under UV. No two are the same, just like me and you. \r\n\r\nThe header card is super flip-overable and magically transform into a playset. Not Transformers, stop it - it's a playset. Yes, a playset (designed by @worsttoyeverdesign)! Made of 100% cardstock and ink!! This playset will allow you to get deeply into immersive play with your Creep, you will spend days marching him around from one side of the card to the next, spinning tales of horror and dread. But wait.... there's more! Each comes with an accurate to scale tombstone! Or, is it a gravestone? Anyway... Each comes with a little grave marker that may glow or not, may light up under uv or not, it may do nothing at all but mark an imaginary grave - that's ok. It has a little space on it for you to write a loved one's name or maybe someone you'd like to see dead. This is your place to be you - so, be you.\r\n\r\nEach Creep comes bagged and tagged like any good corpse. And, they all have thumbs.\r\n","opts":[{"name":"1","sold":true},{"name":"2","sold":true},{"name":"3","sold":true},{"name":"4","sold":true},{"name":"5","sold":true},{"name":"6","sold":true},{"name":"7","sold":true},{"name":"8","sold":true},{"name":"9","sold":true},{"name":"10","sold":true},{"name":"11","sold":true},{"name":"12","sold":true}],"files":["img/024-1.webp","img/024-2.webp","img/024-3.webp","img/024-4.webp","img/024-5.webp"]},{"n":25,"name":"Rata de Arbol Satanica (Satanic Tree Rat)","slug":"rata-de-arbol-satanica-satanic-tree-rat","price":16.66,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-10-24","desc":"This Fall, a simple minded squirrel plunged his stupid little hands deep into the Earth, looking for a place to stash his acorn. Unbeknownst to him, he was digging into a vortex of space, time and faith. His grubby little nails levered into a crack that was the only seal between this world and the one below. Primordial ooze flowed, demons spewed from the strata like mint mentos in a warm bottle of coke. The poor little bugger (yes, now I feel sorry for him) struggled to hang on to his acorn and the very fabric of reality as Beelzebub himself emerged from the inter-dimensional  fracture. Having suffered millennia of thirst, the lord of darkness embraced our little furry protagonist as a herald sent forth to welcome the king. Within seconds they were one. Flesh, fur and pure visceral evil became one. This is the story of La Rata de Arbol Satanica... Take heed, keep your eyes open and one on the ground for He is now everywhere....\r\n\r\nOk, not really. I just found this really weird squirrel head laying around and fell in love with it. I knew it could be better, so here it is. Squirrels are weird as are most furry things that run around in the grass and eat nuts (myself included).\r\n\r\nI threw in an option to have him mounted on a plaque - or, you can get one at Michael's and glue it on yourself.\r\n\r\nI hope that you enjoy these.  They are life size. They are all hand cast in hard resin. Most have glow in the dark eyes. Some glow all over. Some don't glow at all. Some are mounted. Some are two headed. I made the graphics myself, that's why it looks like I made it myself.\r\n\r\nThat is all. Enjoy the show. ","opts":[{"name":"Black Satanic Tree Rat with GID eyes","sold":true},{"name":"Metallic Tree Rat - Gold/silver Metalic","sold":true},{"name":"Metallic Tree Rat - Purple/Pink Flake Metalic","sold":true},{"name":"Trans Trans UV Green Satanic Tree Rat ","sold":true},{"name":"Trans Trans UV Green - GID green eyes Satanic Tree Rat ","sold":true},{"name":"Toxic green marbled Satanic Tree Rat ","sold":true},{"name":"Super Trippy UV Swirl Satanic Tree Rat","sold":true},{"name":"Clearish white GID with GID pink eyes","sold":true},{"name":"MOUNTING SERVICE (Must buy Rat as well)","sold":false}],"files":["img/025-1.webp","img/025-2.webp","img/025-3.webp","img/025-4.webp","img/025-5.webp"]},{"n":26,"name":"The Blood King","slug":"the-blood-king","price":6,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-02-09","desc":"An homage to 1970s fast food icons in keepsake ornament form. Hand cast in translucent blood-red resin. The ribbon hanger can be removed off-season for desktop display.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/026-1.webp","img/026-2.webp"]},{"n":27,"name":"Return of the Crypt Creeper","slug":"return-of-the-crypt-creeper","price":16.66,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-10-24","desc":"You asked, so he's back. The Crypt Creeper returns. He's a 100% bootleg freak from the board game, but I have made him better. That's the whole point of bootlegging right? Anyway... Most of these little dudes are double pour (meaning that they have basically been cast twice - two resin batches, twice in the pressure pot). Their fleshless faces glow like the sun (green/blue more than red/orange) in the dark and some even glow more under UV. No two are the same, just like me and you. \r\n\r\nThe header card is super flip-overable and magically transform into a playset. Not Transformers, stop it - it's a playset. Yes, a playset (designed by @worsttoyeverdesign)! Made of 100% cardstock and ink!! This playset will allow you to get deeply into immersive play with your Creep, you will spend days marching him around from one side of the card to the next, spinning tales of horror and dread. But wait.... there's more! Each comes with an accurate to scale tombstone! Or, is it a gravestone? Anyway... Each comes with a little grave marker that may glow or not, may light up under uv or not, it may do nothing at all but mark an imaginary grave - that's ok. It has a little space on it for you to write a loved one's name or maybe someone you'd like to see dead. This is your place to be you - so, be you.\r\n\r\nEach Creep comes bagged and tagged like any good corpse. And, they all have thumbs.\r\n","opts":[{"name":"Rotting BLUE GID face, Black cloak","sold":true},{"name":"Rotting GREEN GID face, Black cloak","sold":true}],"files":["img/027-1.webp","img/027-2.webp","img/027-3.webp","img/027-4.webp"]},{"n":28,"name":"Return of the Crypt Creeper - One offs","slug":"return-of-the-crypt-creeper-one-offs","price":16.66,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-10-24","desc":"You asked, so he's back. The Crypt Creeper returns. He's a 100% bootleg freak from the board game, but I have made him better. That's the whole point of bootlegging right? Anyway... Most of these little dudes are double pour (meaning that they have basically been cast twice - two resin batches, twice in the pressure pot). Their fleshless faces glow like the sun (green/blue more than red/orange) in the dark and some even glow more under UV. No two are the same, just like me and you. \r\n\r\nThe header card is super flip-overable and magically transform into a playset. Not Transformers, stop it - it's a playset. Yes, a playset (designed by @worsttoyeverdesign)! Made of 100% cardstock and ink!! This playset will allow you to get deeply into immersive play with your Creep, you will spend days marching him around from one side of the card to the next, spinning tales of horror and dread. But wait.... there's more! Each comes with an accurate to scale tombstone! Or, is it a gravestone? Anyway... Each comes with a little grave marker that may glow or not, may light up under uv or not, it may do nothing at all but mark an imaginary grave - that's ok. It has a little space on it for you to write a loved one's name or maybe someone you'd like to see dead. This is your place to be you - so, be you.\r\n\r\nEach Creep comes bagged and tagged like any good corpse. And, they all have thumbs.\r\n\r\n","opts":[{"name":"Spectral Vision clear/black GID rotting face","sold":true},{"name":"Spectral Vision clear/black GID orange rotting face","sold":true},{"name":"Slightly miscast face, Trans UV Green cloak GID rotting face","sold":true},{"name":"Trans Red cloak GID rotting face","sold":true},{"name":"Orange GID rotting face, black cloak","sold":true},{"name":"UV white cloak, Orange GID rotting faces","sold":true},{"name":"Trans UV Green - single pour","sold":true},{"name":"Trans UV Blue - single pour","sold":true},{"name":"Trans UV Orange - single pour","sold":true}],"files":["img/028-1.webp","img/028-2.webp","img/028-3.webp","img/028-4.webp","img/028-5.webp"]},{"n":29,"name":"Rata de Arbol Satanica (Satanic Tree Rat) - Others","slug":"rata-de-arbol-satanica-satanic-tree-rat-others","price":24.66,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-10-24","desc":"This Fall, a simple minded squirrel plunged his stupid little hands deep into the Earth, looking for a place to stash his acorn. Unbeknownst to him, he was digging into a vortex of space, time and faith. His grubby little nails levered into a crack that was the only seal between this world and the one below. Primordial ooze flowed, demons spewed from the strata like mint mentos in a warm bottle of coke. The poor little bugger (yes, now I feel sorry for him) struggled to hang on to his acorn and the very fabric of reality as Beelzebub himself emerged from the inter-dimensional  fracture. Having suffered millennia of thirst, the lord of darkness embraced our little furry protagonist as a herald sent forth to welcome the king. Within seconds they were one. Flesh, fur and pure visceral evil became one. This is the story of La Rata de Arbol Satanica... Take heed, keep your eyes open and one on the ground for He is now everywhere....\r\n\r\nOk, not really. I just found this really weird squirrel head laying around and fell in love with it. I knew it could be better, so here it is. Squirrels are weird as are most furry things that run around in the grass and eat nuts (myself included).\r\n\r\nI hope that you enjoy these.  They are life size. They are all hand cast in hard resin. Most have glow in the dark eyes. Some glow all over. Some don't glow at all. Some are mounted. Some are two headed. I made the graphics myself, that's why it looks like I made it myself.\r\n\r\nThat is all. Enjoy the show. ","opts":[{"name":"Mounted black satanic tree rat mounted","sold":true},{"name":"Ying/Yang Satanic Tree Rat","sold":true}],"files":["img/029-1.webp","img/029-2.webp"]},{"n":30,"name":"Vinny Barbarainbow","slug":"vinny-barbarainbow","price":23,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-02-06","desc":"Does this really need a description? LOL. I just don't even know....  Each Vinny stands at 3 inches tall and is cast in translucent resin (325). The card back features a twisted game of Operation... This is my first real attempt at doing the card art by myself. I tried... hahaha","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/030-1.webp","img/030-2.webp","img/030-3.webp"]},{"n":31,"name":"BerniE.T. Part II: Beyond the Pale","slug":"bernie-t-part-ii-beyond-the-pale","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-02-06","desc":"Poor BerniET. People have been asking for more BerniETs and of course we had to put him in mittens on the card. Thanks once again to @worsttoyeverdesign for the card art. ","opts":[{"name":"Green GID with Green wash","sold":true},{"name":"Flesh","sold":true},{"name":"Crystal Clear ","sold":true},{"name":"UV Green","sold":true},{"name":"Green GID with Black wash","sold":true}],"files":["img/031-1.webp","img/031-2.webp","img/031-3.webp","img/031-4.webp"]},{"n":32,"name":"Mork & Monkey","slug":"mork-monkey","price":20,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-02-06","desc":"Again, I just don't know. This started as a paint-a-figure kit that I picked up at a flea market. When I sat down to mold it, the Mindy sculpt was so bad that she looked like a monkey... and this was born. The original Mindy head has been removed and replaced with a 3d printed head that I sculpted hair on. This was literally one of the funnest project I have ever worked on.\r\n\r\nThe card art... I mean... just... My partner in crime @worsttoyecverdesign is a genius. I can bring him a stupid idea like this and bam! A masterpiece.\r\n\r\nEach Mork and Monkey is hand cast in opaque Ork red and stand at just about 4 inches tall - though I doubt you'll want to open this one. The card back is just amazing as the front.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/032-1.webp","img/032-2.webp","img/032-3.webp","img/032-4.webp","img/032-5.webp"]},{"n":33,"name":"Johnny De-Kai : Raw Meat Edition","slug":"johnny-de-kai","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-10-08","desc":"Brought to you by @therojotoy, @simian_cheese and @WorstToyEverDesign.\r\n\r\nJohhny De-Kai (get it... decay) and comes in just under 3 inches tall and is cast in hard resin to hold in all of his meaty goodness. He can take a blow if you don't mind getting raw meaty stuff all over you. He is currently ranked #1... or just picked up a medal somewhere.\r\n\r\nEach Johnny De-Kai comes bagged with an awesome kung fu tournament backdrop header card. \r\n\r\nSnatch him up before he's gone!","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/033-1.webp","img/033-2.webp","img/033-3.webp","img/033-4.webp","img/033-5.webp"]},{"n":34,"name":"Johnny De-Kai One-Offs","slug":"johnny-de-kai-one-offs","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-10-08","desc":"Brought to you by @therojotoy, @simian_cheese and @WorstToyEverDesign.\r\n\r\nJohhny De-Kai (get it... decay) and comes in just under 3 inches tall and is cast in hard resin to hold in all of his meaty goodness. He can take a blow if you don't mind getting raw meaty stuff all over you. He is currently ranked #1... or just picked up a medal somewhere.\r\n\r\nThese are each a unique color, no two are alike. You will own one of one. How cool is that? Only you. \r\n\r\nEach Johnny De-Kai comes bagged with an awesome kung fu tournament backdrop header card. \r\n\r\nSnatch him up before he's gone!","opts":[{"name":"A - Clear Red Johnny","sold":true},{"name":"B - UV Yellow Johnny","sold":true},{"name":"C - UV Pink Johnny","sold":true},{"name":"D - Muscle Red Johnny","sold":true},{"name":"E - Clear UV GID Blue Johnny","sold":true},{"name":"F - Clear Green GID Johnny","sold":true},{"name":"G - Milky Blue Johnny","sold":true}],"files":["img/034-1.webp","img/034-2.webp","img/034-3.webp"]},{"n":35,"name":"Wasteland Punx","slug":"wasteland-punx","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-04-05","desc":"Don't mess with the Wasteland Punx! This Fink Angel has been recast in UV red/orange hard resin and is ready for action. He wields a cleaver/mace combo that will leave you wanting more pain. \r\n\r\nEach has been hand cast by the Cheese Master and the simply awesome card art by the amazing @worst_toy_ever_designs","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/035-1.webp","img/035-2.webp","img/035-3.webp"]},{"n":36,"name":"The Accomplice Hand - The Bad One 4 & 5","slug":"the-accomplice-hand-the-bad-one","price":25,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-04-19","desc":"Each one of these murderous little bastards is cast in durable urethane rubber (task-16). He's been under pressure in the interrogation pot three times. Once to explain the red nose, again to explain the blood and then finally the glove... I mean who wears a glove all of the time?? \r\n\r\nEach comes bagged with an amazing header card designed by @wtedesign. ","opts":[{"name":"Bad Guy #4","sold":true},{"name":"Bad Guy #5","sold":true}],"files":["img/036-1.webp","img/036-2.webp","img/036-3.webp","img/036-4.webp","img/036-5.webp"]},{"n":37,"name":"Hypno Ghoul Head - by Mr. Evil and Simian & Sons  - EINP","slug":"hypno-ghoul-head-by-mr-evil-and-simian-sons-def","price":25,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-05-18","desc":"The Hypno Ghoul Head, a killer collab between the one and only Mr. Evil and Simian & Sons. Each is hand crafted and cast in hard resin with metallic powders cast right in. These are not painted. \r\n\r\nEach comes in a hand made box with a unique gallows pole for the ghoul to sit upon.\r\n\r\nThey come in a variety of colors, I hope you find one that you like. \r\n\r\nThis was inked by @jasonevilcovelli, sculpted by my kid and printed/molded/cast by me - a true collaboration.\r\n\r\n","opts":[{"name":"E","sold":true},{"name":"I","sold":true},{"name":"N","sold":false},{"name":"P","sold":true}],"files":["img/037-1.webp","img/037-2.webp","img/037-3.webp","img/037-4.webp"]},{"n":38,"name":"The Accomplice Hand - The Bad One 6 & 7","slug":"the-accomplice-hand-the-bad-one-6-7","price":25,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-04-19","desc":"Each one of these murderous little bastards is cast in durable urethane rubber (task-16). He's been under pressure in the interrogation pot three times. Once to explain the red nose, again to explain the blood and then finally the glove... I mean who wears a glove all of the time?? \r\n\r\nEach comes bagged with an amazing header card designed by @wtedesign. ","opts":[{"name":"Bad Guy #6","sold":true},{"name":"Bad Guy #7","sold":true}],"files":["img/038-1.webp","img/038-2.webp","img/038-3.webp","img/038-4.webp"]},{"n":39,"name":"Weird Wendys","slug":"weird-wendys","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-04-19","desc":"None of these have bones.... Just sacks of strangeness. Each one unique...\r\n\r\nOne is dark and dreary until the lights go out. One has been though hell. The other just glows like a mofo.\r\n\r\nEach comes bagged with an amazing header card designed by @wtedesign. I can only post 5 pics per item... so I can't show it off here... boo!","opts":[{"name":"Dark Glow Wendy","sold":true},{"name":"Grandhouse Wendy","sold":true},{"name":"GID Green Wendy","sold":true}],"files":["img/039-1.webp","img/039-2.webp","img/039-3.webp","img/039-4.webp","img/039-5.webp"]},{"n":40,"name":"Inter-Dimensional Beast","slug":"inter-dimensional-beast","price":26,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-06-24","desc":"Worst Toy Ever Design and Simian Cheese are proud to bring you the Inter-Dimensional Beast! Brought through a worm-hole from 1997 Wendy's and Deter's Lab, straight into the Simian Expander machine and finally into the Inter-Dimensional Beast Containment Unit. \r\n\r\nThis sucker is a giant at just over three inches tall! He glows at night and will eat your children's faces during the day. The Containment Unit was designed by Worst Toy Ever Design and should only be opened by the rightful adopted parent (adoption certificate included). \r\n\r\nSimian nor Toy are responsible for any mayhem or destruction brought about by your Beast. It's on you. All you. Don't blame us. You have been warned. Open at your own risk.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/040-1.webp","img/040-2.webp","img/040-3.webp","img/040-4.webp","img/040-5.webp"]},{"n":41,"name":"The Accomplice Hand - The Good One # 1, #2 & #3","slug":"the-accomplice-hand","price":22,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-04-19","desc":"Each one of these murderous little bastards is cast in durable urethane rubber (task-16). Each has been put in the pressure pot twice - once for his red nose and then again for his glove. \r\n\r\nEach comes bagged with an amazing header card designed by @wtedesign. ","opts":[{"name":"Good Guy #1","sold":true},{"name":"Good Guy #2","sold":true},{"name":"Good Guy #3","sold":true}],"files":["img/041-1.webp","img/041-2.webp","img/041-3.webp","img/041-4.webp"]},{"n":42,"name":"Route 1 Saugus Mini-Golf Dino","slug":"route-1-saugus-mini-golf-dino","price":25,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-08-01","desc":"In memory of the Route 1 Mini Golf in Saugus MA which I hear is now some condos. I drove by this guy for years - he got me through some tough traffic... Thanks orange dino. And thanks to my buddy @freekaratechops for the idea.\r\n\r\nEach bootleg dino stands just under 5.5 inches tall and is cast in UV ORANGE GID RED hard resin, hand 'painted' and clear coated.  These are cast from a 1963 NY World's Fair Mold-O-Rama Dinosaur. ","opts":[{"name":"Route 1 Saugus Mini-Golf Dino #1 - GID RED","sold":true},{"name":"Route 1 Saugus Mini-Golf Dino #2 - GID RED","sold":true}],"files":["img/042-1.webp","img/042-2.webp","img/042-3.webp"]},{"n":43,"name":"LEGEND IN MY POCKET","slug":"legend-in-my-pocket","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-06-23","desc":"Fresh from the Cheese Mill comes Legend In My Pocket. Sculpted by @therojotoy, inspired by the Legend himself, @officialgeraldokamura  and beautifully packaged by @wtedesign. Every Legend has been hand cast by the Cheese Master himself in GID hard resin (smooth-cast 325). Each one glows with the pure energy of Master Okamura - Green Legend grows green (go figure), Blue Legend glows Blue (yep) and the Orange Legend glows.... red. \r\n\r\nEach comes in a holo bag specifically designed to contain the power within. \r\nThis is an EDC figure, one for your pocket to remind to play a little. Maybe not play in your pocket... take him out first... because you never know what people will think.","opts":[{"name":"Blue GID Blue Legend","sold":true},{"name":"Green GID Green Legend","sold":true},{"name":"Orange GID Red","sold":true}],"files":["img/043-1.webp","img/043-2.webp","img/043-3.webp","img/043-4.webp","img/043-5.webp"]},{"n":44,"name":"Resinsaurs","slug":"resinsaurs","price":21,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-08-01","desc":"Some would even say they GLOW!! Well, all but the purple glitter one, he just glitters...\r\n\r\nEach bootleg dino stands just under 5.5 inches tall and is cast in hard resin and clear coated.  These are cast from a 1963 NY World's Fair Mold-O-Rama Dinosaur. ","opts":[{"name":"Trans Red / Red GID","sold":true},{"name":"Trans Purple Glitter","sold":true},{"name":"Trans UV Green / Green GID","sold":true},{"name":"Opaque My Favorite Blue","sold":true},{"name":"Opaque Not Barney Purple","sold":true}],"files":["img/044-1.webp","img/044-2.webp","img/044-3.webp","img/044-4.webp","img/044-5.webp"]},{"n":45,"name":"Dinosaurs Have Been Eating My Toys","slug":"dinosaurs-have-been-eating-my-toys","price":23,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-08-01","desc":"Some of my minis have gone missing and now I know why... Each bootleg dino stands just under 5.5 inches tall and is cast in clear hard resin and clear coated. Each dino contains one full size MUSCLE or Freakos Slay Blade. These are cast from a 1963 NY World's Fair Mold-O-Rama Dinosaur. ","opts":[{"name":"A NY Dinosaur Ate My MUSCLE #1","sold":true},{"name":"A NY Dinosaur Ate My MUSCLE #2","sold":true},{"name":"A NY Dinosaur Ate My MUSCLE #3","sold":true},{"name":"A NY Dinosaur Ate My Freakos Slay Blade","sold":true}],"files":["img/045-1.webp","img/045-2.webp","img/045-3.webp","img/045-4.webp"]},{"n":46,"name":"One Spin of the Monkey Machine","slug":"one-spin-of-the-monkey-machine","price":5,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-04-19","desc":"5$ gets you 1 spin of my gumball machine that is full of fun capsules. Each capsule either contains 5 NANO HANDS or 10 NANO HANDS or 5 NANO HANDS AND A NANO CLYCOPTUS. I am sure some other random stuff will make its way in too... Tomorrow (Monday the 18th) at 8pm Eastern I will record the spins. Each spin will have a name attached and will get whatever comes out. It should be fun but could go catastrophically wrong - either way it will be interesting... LOL. If they sell out sooner, I will do the draw sooner... hint hint... \r\n\r\nEach of these is super tiny and no two are alike. They are hand made and did I mention super tiny? ","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/046-1.webp","img/046-2.webp","img/046-3.webp","img/046-4.webp","img/046-5.webp"]},{"n":47,"name":"Glo-Bones Wendy - Wendy 1 & Wendy 2","slug":"glo-bones-wendy","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-04-19","desc":"Yes, these are strange. I sculpted a little set of bones for her and cast them in glow in the dark resin then put her back in the pot for a second time to put her skin on. They are creepy as hell... people will ask you what is wrong with you. Maybe even why you would buy such a a thing. That's reason enough to buy one - or even two if you want them to think you are extra strange,\r\n\r\nEach comes bagged with an amazing header card designed by @wtedesign. ","opts":[{"name":"Wendy 1 - Clear resin with pink GID bones","sold":true},{"name":"Wendy 2 - Clear resin with Gold, GID blue bones","sold":true}],"files":["img/047-1.webp","img/047-2.webp","img/047-3.webp","img/047-4.webp","img/047-5.webp"]},{"n":48,"name":"Glo-Bones Wendy - Wendy 3 ","slug":"glo-bones-wendy-wendy-3-wendy-4","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-04-19","desc":"Yes, these are strange. I sculpted a little set of bones for her and cast them in glow in the dark resin then put her back in the pot for a second time to put her skin on. They are creepy as hell... people will ask you what is wrong with you. Maybe even why you would buy such a a thing. That's reason enough to buy one - or even two if you want them to think you are extra strange,\r\n\r\nEach comes bagged with an amazing header card designed by @wtedesign. ","opts":[{"name":"Wendy 3 - Clear resin with pink GID bones","sold":true}],"files":["img/048-1.webp","img/048-2.webp","img/048-3.webp"]},{"n":49,"name":"Cycloptus the Unstoppable Titan","slug":"cycloptus-the-unstoppable-terror","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-12-11","desc":"Standing at just about 3 inches tall, this rubbery little bugger will do nothing but make you smile. \r\n\r\nHe is hand cast in keshi-like rubber in monochrome and/or cast with metallic powders. AMAZING card art by the one and only @worsttoyeverdesin\r\n\r\nCHOOSE BETWEEN METALLIC/NON-METALLIC AND SPECIFY COLOR PREFERENCE IN THE ORDER NOTES. I WILL DO MY BEST TO MAKE YOU HAPPY. IF THERE IS A COLOR THAT YOU WOULD HATE TO HAVE, MENTION IT AS WELL. ","opts":[{"name":"Metallic Cycloptus the Unstoppable Titan","sold":true},{"name":"Non Metallic Cycloptus the Unstoppable Titan","sold":true}],"files":["img/049-1.webp","img/049-2.webp","img/049-3.webp","img/049-4.webp","img/049-5.webp"]},{"n":50,"name":"Udon Master One-Offs","slug":"udon-master-one-offs","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-10-08","desc":"The Udon Master designed and sculpted by @therojotoy. \r\nEach is cast in fantastical hard resin in various colors and stands at just about 2 inches tall. \r\nEach Master will come bagged with a fun filled kung fu tournament backdrop designed by @worst_toy_ever_design.","opts":[{"name":"A - Metallic Blue Master","sold":true},{"name":"B - Army Green Master","sold":true},{"name":"C - Pink Master","sold":true},{"name":"D - Milky Blue Master","sold":true},{"name":"E - Metallic Holo Master","sold":true}],"files":["img/050-1.webp","img/050-2.webp"]},{"n":51,"name":"Mad Spout","slug":"mad-spout","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-06-01","desc":"Get a hold of Mad Spout before he's gone!!! He comes in a variety of UV reactive colors that light up light the night under uv. They are cast in translucent hard resin and are sure to satisfy. Hand cast by the Cheese Master and all dressed up for the party by Worst Toy Ever Design.\r\n\r\nEach comes bagged with a glorious full color header card designed by Worst Toy Ever Designs.\r\n","opts":[{"name":"UV Blue","sold":true},{"name":"UV Yellow","sold":true},{"name":"UV Purple","sold":true},{"name":"UV Orange","sold":true},{"name":"UV Green","sold":true},{"name":"UV Pink","sold":true}],"files":["img/051-1.webp","img/051-2.webp","img/051-3.webp","img/051-4.webp"]},{"n":52,"name":"EDC Pocket Dog - Flaccid","slug":"edc-pocket-dog-flaccid","price":16,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-02-06","desc":"Just so wrong, just so flaccid. These Every Day Carry Pocket Dogs are cast in eco flex 00-30  - SUPER STRETCHY, SUPER WEIRD.... They're not sticky either. I was able to cram a whole bunch of stuff into a few of these. Glow, smell, color change... I just had too much fun.","opts":[{"name":"Purple Nurple","sold":true},{"name":"UV Color Changing (yellow/blue)","sold":true},{"name":"Red ","sold":true},{"name":"UV Color Changing (green/blue) Green GID Banana Scented","sold":true},{"name":"UV Color Changing (yellow/red) Hot Pink GID Strawberry Banana Scented","sold":true}],"files":["img/052-1.webp","img/052-2.webp","img/052-3.webp","img/052-4.webp"]},{"n":53,"name":"Derpy Dogs","slug":"derpy-dogs","price":23,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-02-07","desc":"Again, these fit into the \"I Dunno\" category. I came up with the idea working on a project with @extratruckestrial and here they are.\r\n\r\nEach stand at just about 5 inches. The head is cast in semi-rigid urethane rubber (task-16) and the base is hard resin (325). The head pops off if you like.\r\n\r\nThe belly and hands were painted and then clear coated for extra shininess.","opts":[{"name":"Red","sold":true},{"name":"Blue","sold":true},{"name":"Green","sold":true}],"files":["img/053-1.webp"]},{"n":54,"name":"Barrel of Monkeys from Hell","slug":"barrel-of-monkeys-from-hell","price":7,"status":"sold-out","created":"2021-02-07","desc":"Each barrel comes with 3 evil monkeys from hell. They small, they're evil, they're bootlegs (HEI Vampires). \r\n\r\nEach is cast in hard resin (legs are a bit snappy if squeezed) and stands at about an inch or so tall. This was just fun. \r\n\r\nI made one set in the squishy rubber - they can be stretched and mashed as you like.\r\n\r\nAll credit goes to @worsttoyeverdesign for the barrel art.\r\n\r\n","opts":[{"name":"Hard Resin","sold":false},{"name":"Rubbery Rubber","sold":true}],"files":["img/054-1.webp","img/054-2.webp"]},{"n":55,"name":"Simian Cheese Super Stocking Stuffer Satchel","slug":"simian-cheese-super-stocking-stuffer-satchel","price":25,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-12-11","desc":"#1 Four Freakish Freakos and a Spooky Head\r\n#2 A Fistful of Freakos\r\n#3 A couple of Freakos and some foraging Forgelings\r\n#4 A Skiderball a Spooky Head and a Meaty Murderer - $$ It's a bit more to cover shipping, it's heavy. $$\r\n#5 A couple of Freakos and some foraging Forgelings\r\n\r\n** Forgelings sculpted by @monsterforge and cast by the Main Monkey\r\n** Skiderball scul;pted by Chris Hernandez and cast by Sir Simian\r\n** Spooky Head Drawn by @jasonevilcovelli sculpted by my kid and cast by you know who\r\n** Freakos booted by... yep you guessed it... me.\r\n\r\n","opts":[{"name":"1","sold":true},{"name":"2","sold":true},{"name":"3","sold":false},{"name":"4","sold":true},{"name":"5","sold":false}],"files":["img/055-1.webp","img/055-2.webp","img/055-3.webp","img/055-4.webp","img/055-5.webp"]},{"n":56,"name":"Udon Master : Color Change Edition - Brown to Cooked Udon","slug":"udon-master","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-05-04","desc":"The Udon Master designed and sculpted by @therojotoy. \r\nEach is cast in temperature color change hard resin (black to noodle) and stands at just about 2 inches tall. \r\nEach Master will come in his own fast food container designed by the one and only @worst_toy_ever_design.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/056-1.webp","img/056-2.webp","img/056-3.webp"]},{"n":57,"name":"Rex Kwon-Do : Army Green Edition","slug":"rex-kwon-do","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-10-08","desc":"Brought to you by @therojotoy, @simian_cheese and @WorstToyEverDesign.\r\n\r\nThis little bugger and comes in just under 3 inches tall is cast in hard resin so that he can take the punches. Blocking is not his strength... with the short arms and all. \r\n\r\nEach Rex Kwon-Do comes bagged with an awesome kung fu tournament backdrop header card. Wow, that was a mouthful.\r\n\r\nSnatch him up before he's gone!","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/057-1.webp","img/057-2.webp","img/057-3.webp","img/057-4.webp"]},{"n":58,"name":"Rex Kwon-Do One-Offs","slug":"rex-kwon-do-one-offs","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-10-08","desc":"Brought to you by @therojotoy, @simian_cheese and @WorstToyEverDesign.\r\n\r\nThis little bugger and comes in just under 3 inches tall is cast in hard resin so that he can take the punches. Blocking is not his strength... with the short arms and all. \r\n\r\nEach Rex Kwon-Do comes bagged with an awesome kung fu tournament backdrop header card. Wow, that was a mouthful.\r\n\r\nEach one-off is unique (hence the name), no two colors alike. Get the one you want before he's gone. ","opts":[{"name":"A - UV Yellow Rex","sold":true},{"name":"B - UV Green Rex","sold":true},{"name":"C - Cool Ice Rex","sold":true},{"name":"D - Purple Nurple Rex","sold":true},{"name":"E - UV Orange Rex","sold":true},{"name":"F - Slightly Transparent Green Rex","sold":true},{"name":"G - UV Green Transparent Rex","sold":true}],"files":["img/058-1.webp","img/058-2.webp","img/058-3.webp"]},{"n":59,"name":"Freakos #8 CASSY SPELLA","slug":"freakos-8-cassy-spella","price":12,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-12-11","desc":"The last of the Freakos... Cassy Spella is cast in UV pink hard resin. \r\nShe's sexy, she's sassy, she has a freakin' BAT ON HER SHOULDER! What's not to love. Bagged in amazing packaging by @worsttoyeverdesign\r\n\r\nThis was such a fun line to bring back to life with modern plastics in modern colors. Thank you for all of your Freako-ish support over the years.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/059-1.webp","img/059-2.webp","img/059-3.webp","img/059-4.webp"]},{"n":60,"name":"MiniJuice and Mini Mound","slug":"minijuice-and-mini-mound","price":20,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-10-23","desc":"MINIJUICE MINIJUICE MINIJUICE!\r\nThese guys are UV reactive glow-in-the-dark mono minis that are guaranteed to delight in the day, night or blacklight (oh baby). The mound standing on its end (as pictured) is just about 3.5 inches high. \r\n\r\nThese are perfect as they are, but with some wash or some paint??? oh my!\r\n\r\nPic #1 is Blacklight\r\nPic #2 is in the dark(ish)\r\nPic #3 is in normal light","opts":[{"name":"UV Orange RED GID","sold":true},{"name":"UV PINK RED GID","sold":true},{"name":"UV BLUE BLUE GID","sold":true},{"name":"UV YELLOW GREEN GID","sold":true},{"name":"UV GREEN GREEN GID","sold":true}],"files":["img/060-1.webp","img/060-2.webp","img/060-3.webp"]},{"n":61,"name":"EDC Pocket Dog","slug":"edc-pocked-hot-dog","price":11,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-10-08","desc":"\"Is that a hotdog with a hat on in your pocket, or are you just happy to see me? \r\nThese EDC pocket dogs are the answer. Nothing more needs to be said. \r\n\r\nThe green one is semi-rigid while the red is rock hard. \r\n\r\nYes, I made up the term 'pocket dog' - maybe I didn't, but I'm taking credit for it.\r\n\r\nEach comes in a bag, no header card... it would end up being too perverted.","opts":[{"name":"Rock Hard Red Pocket Dog","sold":true},{"name":"Semi-Rigid UV Green Pocket Dog","sold":true}],"files":["img/061-1.webp","img/061-2.webp"]},{"n":62,"name":"Random Grape Ape","slug":"grap-ape","price":7,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-10-08","desc":"I always loved Grape Ape as a kid. This tube ape reminded me of him, so I made him in purple. He is cool. I wish I were keeping one. I guess if you don't buy them, I will. Thank you either way.\r\n\r\nEach is cast in translucent purply hard resin and comes in a bag. No header card, just a bag. He is cool on his own.\r\n\r\nShipping sucks, so buy some other stuff to offset it. Makes sense, right?","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/062-1.webp","img/062-2.webp"]},{"n":63,"name":"Freako #7 Fu Manchu","slug":"freako-7-fu-manchu","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-07-06","desc":"Simian Cheese and Worst Toy Ever Design are proud to bring you the 7th installment of the Freakos line - Fu Manchu.  Fu is hand cast in UV violet transparent hard resin. He almost vanishes before your eyes as he unfurls his cloak. And with some uv light, he is underworldly...\r\n\r\nFu stands just under 3 inches tall and comes in a chip-like bag designed by Worst Toy Ever Designs. ","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/063-1.webp","img/063-2.webp","img/063-3.webp"]},{"n":64,"name":"KILLER CONDIMENT MUSTARD HARMBURGER","slug":"xxx","price":12,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-09-30","desc":"It is my great honor to bring you The Mini Figure Militia's HARMBURGER. This is his first ever appearance in physical form. Get your little meaty stink wad while you can, he won't be around much longer, he's already starting to smell.\r\n\r\nDesigned by @actuallybogleech https://bogleech.com/\r\nSculpted by @bigmantoys https://bigmantoys.bigcartel.com/\r\nProduced by @simian_cheese\r\nHeader by @worst_toy_ever_design\r\nThe Mini Figure Militia @theminifiguremilitia\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/groups/TheMiniFigureMilitia/\r\n💀\r\nKiller Condiment Ketchup and Mustard singles ON SALE FOR $12","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/064-1.webp","img/064-2.webp","img/064-3.webp","img/064-4.webp","img/064-5.webp"]},{"n":65,"name":"2 INCH Micro Mutants","slug":"2-inch-micro-mutants","price":10,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-02-21","desc":"Brought to you by Worst Toy Ever and Simian Cheese, these Mini Mutants went through a DOUBLE shrinkening process through the powers of modern technology and some strange science. \r\n\r\nThese little buggers come in at juuust under two inches and are made of hard resin. \r\n\r\nEach comes in a fancy attache' case to keep him safe in transport. \r\n\r\nEverything is hand made, by hands, with hands and for hands.","opts":[{"name":"Clear/White GID Blue","sold":true},{"name":"Clear/White GID Green","sold":true},{"name":"Brown","sold":true},{"name":"Red","sold":true},{"name":"UV Green GID","sold":true},{"name":"UV Green","sold":true}],"files":["img/065-1.webp","img/065-2.webp","img/065-3.webp","img/065-4.webp","img/065-5.webp"]},{"n":66,"name":"Derpy Dave","slug":"derpy-dave","price":10,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-03-17","desc":"Derpy Dave was sculpted by my 13 year old son using Blender 3D and brought to fruition in the Cheese Mill. Derpy Dave is perfect as a backpack hanger, a projectile for sibling combat, a cat toy, a desk ornament, just to name a few. \r\n\r\nGet yours now!!!\r\n\r\nIt is such an honor and joy to do this project with my kid.... so awesome.","opts":[{"name":"Flesh","sold":false},{"name":"Yellow","sold":false},{"name":"Safety Orange","sold":false},{"name":"Blue","sold":false}],"files":["img/066-1.webp","img/066-2.webp","img/066-3.webp","img/066-4.webp","img/066-5.webp"]},{"n":67,"name":"Kosmo Nugget","slug":"kosmo-nugget","price":12,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-12-16","desc":"Legend has it that this little nugget was intended as a fast food premium to commemorate the Space Shuttle Challenger, but unfortunately, due to certain events... never went into production. So here it is for the first time ever.  \r\n\r\nHe is lovingly hand cast in hard resin with shiny metallic green/red/gold flakes which makes him appear meteoric and heroic at the same time.\r\n\r\nHis spaceship capsule rides upon the clouds as he glides through the holographic cosmos in his hand made box (made by me, designed by Wost Toy Ever Design). Nothing was missed, he even has a teeny tiny control panel to help him guide his way.\r\n\r\nTHIS GUY IS OUT OF THIS WORLD!!! \r\n\r\nBrought to you by Illuminatoys, Simiancheese and Worst Toy Ever Design\r\n\r\n","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/067-1.webp","img/067-2.webp","img/067-3.webp","img/067-4.webp","img/067-5.webp"]},{"n":68,"name":"Kung Fu Claw","slug":"kung-fu-claw","price":20,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-08-06","desc":"I am super excited and proud to bring you this killer collab between @officialgeraldokamura (hand model), @nopal62 (original artwork) @worst_toy_ever_design (packaging) @simian_cheese (print/mold/cast/packaging) and NoGoodName(3D sculptor).\r\n\r\nTHE KUNG FU CLAW stands just under 3 inches and is made of keshi-like rubber. They are hand cast by the Cheese Master in day-glo uv colors (and black).\r\n\r\nEach comes on a blister card designed by the one and only @worst_toy_ever_design.","opts":[{"name":"UV Blue","sold":true},{"name":"UV Red","sold":true},{"name":"UV Green","sold":true},{"name":"UV Orange","sold":true},{"name":"UV Yellow","sold":true},{"name":"UV Purple","sold":true},{"name":"Black","sold":true}],"files":["img/068-1.webp","img/068-2.webp","img/068-3.webp","img/068-4.webp","img/068-5.webp"]},{"n":69,"name":"Neon Helping Hand v2.0","slug":"neon-helping-hand-v2-0","price":25,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-06-01","desc":"Inspired by Illuminatoys, cast by the Cheese Master and dressed up by Worst Toy Ever Designs, Version 2.0 of The Helping Hand is here. This time in new NEON (UV Reactive) colors and a kinder rubber (task16). Each is hand cast with love and some would even say some glow.\r\n\r\nEach person that purchase a helping hand between drop time (sunday 5/31 at 9pm EDT) and Monday night, June 1 at 9pm will be entered to win the Raver Helping Hand as seen in the last pic. That's right - just purchase one and you are entered to win!!!\r\n\r\nEach comes bagged with a glorious full color header card designed by Worst Toy Ever Designs.","opts":[{"name":"UV Yellow","sold":true},{"name":"UV Orange","sold":true},{"name":"UV Purple","sold":true},{"name":"UV Blue","sold":true},{"name":"UV Green","sold":true},{"name":"UV Pink","sold":true},{"name":"Red","sold":true}],"files":["img/069-1.webp","img/069-2.webp","img/069-3.webp","img/069-4.webp","img/069-5.webp"]},{"n":70,"name":"Monstro - Random color - Put color preference in order notes","slug":"monstro","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-07-06","desc":"Simian Cheese,  Worst Toy Ever Design and Illuminatoys,proudly introduce Monstro - The Hideous Alien. Monstro is a tribute to the toys of yesteryear that you might find in any gas station along that highway in the middle of nowhere. You know the one. Remember?\r\n\r\nThis little rubbery guy is cat in semi-rigid resin and stands just under 3 inches tall. He's a perfect pocket pal and will always have a hand in the air like he just don't care. Each Monstro comes bagged with an amazing header card by the one and only @worsttoyeverdesign. Everything was made by hand in-house by the head Simian at large with the bootleg source from the one and only Cheap Toy Man.\r\n\r\nPut your color preference in the order notes and I will do my best to get you want you want. First come, first serve.\r\n\r\n","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/070-1.webp","img/070-2.webp","img/070-3.webp","img/070-4.webp","img/070-5.webp"]},{"n":71,"name":"Slime Planet Puggernaut - Official OMFG Exclusive","slug":"slime-planet-puggernaut","price":12,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-04-28","desc":"A long time ago in a galaxy far, far away…\r\nPugnacious and Barbarianuat, having slipped through the vortex of a black hole, emerge as a singular unstoppable galactic warrior, The Puggernaut!\r\nInfused with the power cosmic, Puggernaut harnesses the energies of each unique world in order to extinguish tyranny throughout the cosmos!\r\n\r\nPresented by The Mini Figure Militia.\r\nPuggernaut kitbash by Charles Marsh (Monsterforge) and cast by Joe Martis (Simian Cheese).\r\nHeader art by Charles Marsh and designed by Worst Toy Ever.\r\nPugnacious designed by Bill MacKay (Berserker Studios) and sculpted by George Gaspar (Double G Toys).\r\nBarbarianaut by Charles Marsh.\r\nPugnacious and Barbarianaut originally featured as part of OMFG from October Toys.\r\n\r\nPhotos by Lacerta Photo","opts":[{"name":"Slime Planet","sold":true}],"files":["img/071-1.webp","img/071-2.webp","img/071-3.webp","img/071-4.webp","img/071-5.webp"]},{"n":72,"name":"5 Random Mini Helping Hands - Put color pref in order notes","slug":"5-random-mini-helping-hands","price":20,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-07-06","desc":"Through the wonders of modern science, the Helping Hand has been shrunken! He now stands at 1 3/4 inches....!!! Slightly smaller than your average MUSCLE figure. He is lovingly hand cast in hard resin in a plethora of colors. He is smooth and sexy, a perfect pocket companion who is sure to bring you nothing but smiles. Why 5?!??! Because you need to spread the happiness... give one to a friend, a colleague, a random person. Leave them around randomly to bring smiles to anyone that finds them. \r\n\r\nEach set of 5 will come loose in a random assortment of colors, glitters, glows, UV, color change, and so on. If you have a preference in color, please mention it your order notes. I will try my best to give you want you want, but first come, first served.\r\n\r\nBrought to you by Illuminatoys, Simian Cheese and Worst Toy Ever Design","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/072-1.webp","img/072-2.webp","img/072-3.webp"]},{"n":73,"name":"Jabba the Nugg","slug":"jabba-the-nugg","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-04-05","desc":"Ever wonder what it would look like if you crossed Jabba the Hutt with a Chicken Nugget??? Well, here it is!! Jabba the Nugg!! Each Nugg has been hand cast in hard resin and left in the fryer for varying lengths of time. Colors range from a little raw to slightly overcooked. If you have a preference let me know. \r\n\r\nEach comes in a fancy burlap bag with a beautiful header card by @worst_toy_ever_design\r\n\r\nThis guy has been featured on Mighty Jabba's Collection here if you want a closer look. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hnpr6WN6AI&","opts":[{"name":"#1 Jabba the Nugg","sold":true},{"name":"#2 Jabba the Nugg","sold":true},{"name":"#3 Jabba the Nugg","sold":false},{"name":"#4 Jabba the Nugg","sold":true},{"name":"#5 Jabba the Nugg","sold":false}],"files":["img/073-1.webp","img/073-2.webp","img/073-3.webp","img/073-4.webp","img/073-5.webp"]},{"n":74,"name":"Random Thunder Lips Mini - Loose","slug":"random-thunder-lips-mini","price":4,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-06-01","desc":"One random little Thunder Lips dude. Some are keshi-like, some are hard, you don't get a say, you just get a random one in a random color (seen in the pic).\r\n\r\nThese are loose figures - no header card. I mean, I'll put them in a bag, but nothing fancy right now. ","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/074-1.webp"]},{"n":75,"name":"Thunder Dog","slug":"thunder-dog","price":18,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-06-01","desc":"Strike terror in the heart of any ghost catcher with the Thunder Dog bootleg Companion Ghost Figure by @worst_toy_ever_design. \r\n\r\nIts ghostly translucent blue ectoplasm is also UV reactive! \r\n\r\nLimited quantities available!\r\n\r\nEach comes bagged with a glorious full color header card designed by Worst Toy Ever Designs.\r\n","opts":[{"name":"UV Blue","sold":true},{"name":"UV Blue Scarface","sold":true}],"files":["img/075-1.webp","img/075-2.webp","img/075-3.webp","img/075-4.webp","img/075-5.webp"]},{"n":76,"name":"KILLER CONDIMENT KETCHUP HARMBURGER","slug":"harmburger","price":12,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-09-30","desc":"It is my great honor to bring you The Mini Figure Militia's HARMBURGER. This is his first ever appearance in physical form. Get your little meaty stink wad while you can, he won't be around much longer, he's already starting to smell.\r\n\r\nDesigned by @actuallybogleech https://bogleech.com/\r\nSculpted by @bigmantoys https://bigmantoys.bigcartel.com/\r\nProduced by @simian_cheese\r\nHeader by @worst_toy_ever_design\r\nThe Mini Figure Militia @theminifiguremilitia\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/groups/TheMiniFigureMilitia/\r\n💀\r\nKiller Condiment Ketchup and Mustard singles ON SALE FOR $12","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/076-1.webp","img/076-2.webp","img/076-3.webp","img/076-4.webp","img/076-5.webp"]},{"n":77,"name":"Freakos #3  - GID Bad Mummy ","slug":"gid-bad-mummy-freakos-3","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-11-01","desc":"Simian Cheese and Worst Toy Ever are proud to bring you this homage to a wonderful toy from the distant past, Bad Mummy!\r\n\r\nHe is lovingly hand cast in milky white glow-in0-the-dark resin and packed with extra mummified madness. This little guy has a little pet snake wrapped around his leg - dos it get better than that?  He is the third in a series of eight that I hope to recreate in wonderful modern materials and colors. The brilliant packaging is a collaboration with the amazing Worst Toy Ever. ","opts":[{"name":"White/Clear GID Blue","sold":false},{"name":"White GID Green","sold":true}],"files":["img/077-1.webp","img/077-2.webp","img/077-3.webp","img/077-4.webp"]},{"n":78,"name":"3 INCH Mini Mutant","slug":"3-inch-mini-mutant","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-02-21","desc":"Brought to you by Worst Toy Ever and Simian Cheese, these Mini Mutants went through a SINGLE shrinkening process. \r\n\r\nThey come in at just under 3 inches and are made of hard resin. \r\n\r\nEach comes in a fancy attache' case to keep him safe in transport. \r\n\r\nEverything is hand made, by hands, with hands and for hands.","opts":[{"name":"GID Blue","sold":true},{"name":"GID Green","sold":true},{"name":"Flesh","sold":true},{"name":"Blue","sold":true},{"name":"Red","sold":true}],"files":["img/078-1.webp","img/078-2.webp","img/078-3.webp","img/078-4.webp"]},{"n":79,"name":"Freakos #5 - Double Pour Cruel Ghoul","slug":"freakos-5-cruel-ghoul","price":18,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-04-05","desc":"This ghoulish fiend is fresh off the kill. He has been lovingly double cast with a uv white, green GID face and a bloody clear transparent tip to his weapon.This guy is KILLER, literally. hahahah. No two are the same.\r\n\r\nOnce again, the amazing package graphics are done by @worst_toy_ever_design","opts":[{"name":"Freakos #5 - Double Pour Cruel Ghoul","sold":true},{"name":"MIscast Face Freakos #5 - Double Pour Cruel Ghoul","sold":true}],"files":["img/079-1.webp","img/079-2.webp","img/079-3.webp","img/079-4.webp"]},{"n":80,"name":"Freakos #5 - Cruel Ghoul Bloody Mary Version","slug":"freakos-5-cruel-ghoul-bloody-mary-version","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-04-05","desc":"This ghoulish fiend is fresh off the kill.  Each Cruel Ghoul Bloody Mary variant is a unique marbled red/white resin. No two are the same.\r\n\r\nThis guy is KILLER, literally. hahahah.\r\n\r\nOnce again, the amazing package graphics are done by @worst_toy_ever_design","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/080-1.webp"]},{"n":81,"name":"Freakos #3 - Bad Mummy Golden Road edition","slug":"freakos-3-bad-mummy-golden-road-edition","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-04-05","desc":"I recast a few Bad Mummies in black with a metallic gold dusting with a rainbow holo snake on his leg. ","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/081-1.webp","img/081-2.webp"]},{"n":82,"name":"BerniE.T. 2020","slug":"bernie-t-2020","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-03-03","desc":"Forget about Super Tuesday and celebrate Bernie today with this exclusive BerniE.T. kitbash created by the Cheese Master himself. This tribute stands at three inches and is made of sexy flesh hard resin. @worst_toy_ever_design has really outdone himself with the header card this time... you won't believe your eyes and you'll never laugh so hard. You don't want to miss this one!","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/082-1.webp","img/082-2.webp","img/082-3.webp"]},{"n":83,"name":"Chew Foot - Freakos #4","slug":"chew-foot-freakos-4","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-02-21","desc":"Simian Cheese and Worst Toy Ever are proud to bring you this fourth installment in the Freakos series, Claw Foot!. \r\n\r\nHe is lovingly hand cast in two colors: Transparent Green with Gold Shimmer and Black with Green shimmer. \r\n\r\nThe brilliant packaging is a collaboration with the amazing Worst Toy Ever. ","opts":[{"name":"Clear Green with Gold Shimmer","sold":true},{"name":"Black with Green Shimmer","sold":true}],"files":["img/083-1.webp","img/083-2.webp","img/083-3.webp"]},{"n":84,"name":"Hairy Scarey - Freakos #2","slug":"hairy-scarey-freakos-2","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-11-01","desc":"Simian Cheese and Worst Toy Ever are proud to bring you this homage to a wonderful toy from the distant past, Hairy Scarey!. \r\n\r\nHe is lovingly hand cast in transparent brown resin - kinda looks like a rootbeer barrel (yum) and packed with extra lycanthropic love. He is the second in a series of eight that I hope to recreate in wonderful modern materials and colors. The brilliant packaging is a collaboration with the amazing Worst Toy Ever. ","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/084-1.webp","img/084-2.webp","img/084-3.webp","img/084-4.webp"]},{"n":85,"name":"Freako's #1: Slay Blade","slug":"freako-s-1-slay-blade","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-03-30","desc":"Simian Cheese, Worst Toy Ever and The MFM Bootleg Army are proud to bring you this homage to a wonderful toy from the distant past, Slay Blade. \r\n\r\nHis dagger is bloody and raised, the cloaked fiend carries the head of his victim in his hand for all to see. Beware SLAY BLADE!\r\n\r\nHe is lovingly hand cast in transparent red resin and packed with extra evil. He is the first in a series of eight that I hope to recreate in wonderful modern materials and colors. The brilliant packaging is a collaboration with the amazing Worst Toy Ever. ","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/085-1.webp","img/085-2.webp","img/085-3.webp","img/085-4.webp","img/085-5.webp"]},{"n":86,"name":"Special Edition Halloween Orange Slay Blade Freakos #1","slug":"special-edition-halloween-slay-blade-freakos-1","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-11-01","desc":"Simian Cheese and Worst Toy Ever are proud to bring you this homage to a wonderful toy from the distant past, Slay Blade!\r\n\r\nSlay Blade is back! This time in Extra Spooky Halloween Orange and more murderous than ever!  \r\n\r\nSlay Blade is the first in a series of eight that I hope to recreate in wonderful modern materials and colors. The brilliant packaging is a collaboration with the amazing Worst Toy Ever. ","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/086-1.webp","img/086-2.webp","img/086-3.webp"]},{"n":87,"name":"1.5 INCH - One Random Color Loose Nano Mutant!!","slug":"random-nano-mutants","price":5,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-02-24","desc":"Brought to you by Worst Toy Ever and Simian Cheese, these Mini Mutants went through a TRIPLE shrinkening process through the powers of modern technology and some strange science. \r\n\r\nThese little buggers come in at just about 1.5 inches and are made of hard resin. They'll come bagged, I couldn't make a box this small...\r\n\r\nEverything is hand made, by hands, with hands and for hands.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/087-1.webp","img/087-2.webp","img/087-3.webp","img/087-4.webp","img/087-5.webp"]},{"n":88,"name":"5 Inch Full Size One-Off Clear Mutant with GID Mini Mutant Inside","slug":"5-inch-full-size-clear-mutant-with-gid-mini-mutant-inside","price":50,"status":"sold-out","created":"2020-02-23","desc":"This is a Full Size clear Mutant with a GID Mini Mutant inside. This is a one-of-a-kind piece.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/088-1.webp","img/088-2.webp","img/088-3.webp","img/088-4.webp","img/088-5.webp"]},{"n":89,"name":"First Kiss Spiders","slug":"first-kiss-spiders","price":6,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-04-01","desc":"Can you believe that these were someone's companion? Yikes... Each has been lovingly hand-cast by the head simian and packed with extra creepiness for your enjoyment. Each vicious little toe nipper comes safely contained in a secure bag. These are cast in clear resin with just a kiss of red.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":false}],"files":["img/089-1.webp","img/089-2.webp","img/089-3.webp"]},{"n":90,"name":"Terran Fleshbag Puggernaut - Official OMFG Exclusive","slug":"terran-fleshbag-puggernaut","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-04-28","desc":"A long time ago in a galaxy far, far away…\r\nPugnacious and Barbarianuat, having slipped through the vortex of a black hole, emerge as a singular unstoppable galactic warrior, The Puggernaut!\r\nInfused with the power cosmic, Puggernaut harnesses the energies of each unique world in order to extinguish tyranny throughout the cosmos!\r\n\r\nPresented by The Mini Figure Militia.\r\nPuggernaut kitbash by Charles Marsh (Monsterforge) and cast by Joe Martis (Simian Cheese).\r\nHeader art by Charles Marsh and designed by Worst Toy Ever.\r\nPugnacious designed by Bill MacKay (Berserker Studios) and sculpted by George Gaspar (Double G Toys).\r\nBarbarianaut by Charles Marsh.\r\nPugnacious and Barbarianaut originally featured as part of OMFG from October Toys.\r\n\r\nPhotos by Lacerta Photo","opts":[{"name":"Terran Fleshbag","sold":true}],"files":["img/090-1.webp","img/090-2.webp","img/090-3.webp","img/090-4.webp","img/090-5.webp"]},{"n":91,"name":"Forgelings - Timmit the Blacksmith - Earth Brown","slug":"forgelings-timmit-the-blacksmith","price":20,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-12-09","desc":"Presented exclusively by @theminifiguremilitia, we are proud to present the first offering in an artist spotlight series, with MONSTERFORGE'S FORGELINGS!\r\nCreator/designer @monsterforge in collaboration with MFM castor and line producer @simian_cheese along with MFM graphic designer @worst_toy_ever_design will kick-off the fantasy based mini figure series, Forgelings with Timmit The Blacksmith, dropping tonight (Sunday, December 8th) at 9PM Eastern \r\n\r\nTimmit will be offered in high quality hand poured resin in two limited editions, retailing for $20 + shipping.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out, and get in on the ground floor with this ongoing collaboration, brought to you exclusively by Monsterforge and Team MFM!\r\n\r\nFor International shipping please shoot me a DM @simiancheese.com on IG","opts":[{"name":"Earthen Brown","sold":true}],"files":["img/091-1.webp","img/091-2.webp","img/091-3.webp","img/091-4.webp"]},{"n":92,"name":"Pvt. Ooze - Gang Green Edition","slug":"pvt-ooze","price":13,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-03-30","desc":"File NAME: [CLASSIFIED]\r\nPRIMARY MILITARY SPECIALTY: Infantry\r\nBirthplace: [CLASSIFIED]\r\nPrivate [CLASSIFIED] offered himself voluntarily for a secret government experiment... But something went wrong and now he's become Pvt. OOZE, an unstoppable and sticky war machine!\r\nPrvt. OOZE bootleg created by Worst Toy Ever and lovingly hand cast by the one and only Simian Cheese. Part of The Mini Figure Militia's Bootleg Army.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/092-1.webp","img/092-2.webp","img/092-3.webp","img/092-4.webp"]},{"n":93,"name":"Video NasteeZ Rawhead Rex","slug":"rawhead-rex","price":15,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-08-25","desc":"In collaboration with Illuminatoys and Worst Toy Ever, I am very proud to bring you this 5th Anniversary Edition of Video NasteeZ Rawhead Rex. Yes, it has been 5 years since he was last cast... This little marvel is lovingly hand made by the Cheese Master himself in a semi-rigid resin in four glorious colors (White/Blue/UV Green/GID). Each mini comes with a custom-cast removable skeletal warrior stand to make sure he stands up any resistance from his enemies. This is a super short run, so be sure to get him before he's gone. \r\n~2.5 inches standing, ~3 inches standing on base","opts":[{"name":"White","sold":true},{"name":"UV Green","sold":true},{"name":"White GID","sold":true},{"name":"Blue","sold":true}],"files":["img/093-1.webp","img/093-2.webp","img/093-3.webp","img/093-4.webp","img/093-5.webp"]},{"n":94,"name":"Ram-Blo","slug":"ram-blo","price":12,"status":"sold-out","created":"2019-06-16","desc":"NAME: Yo Ram-blo\r\nNATIONALITY: AMERICANO\r\nAGE: UNKNOWN/CLASSIFIED/NOT RATED/UNRATED/XXX-RATED\r\nHEIGHT: ~4 INCHES\r\nMATERIAL: HARD RESIN\r\nCOLOR: RANDOM GUMBALL COLORS\r\n\r\nHOBBIES AND OCCUPATIONS: Green Beret, Pink Beret, Special Services, Special OPs, Secret Service, NAVY SEAL, Commie Annihilator, Shriners Club, 4H Club, Quilting Club, Cat Lady, Potential Bubblegum Assassinator.\r\n\r\nWEAPONS: Sexy Knife Blade, Ram-Bow and Arrow, Dip Spit, Vanity Mirror, Fanny Pack, Hot Pack.  \r\n\r\nSTORYLINE: Nobody can get out of a ooey, gooey, huey mess like Yo Ram-blo. Tasked with all of the world's \"ultra secret operational overseas death rescue missions with panache\" Ram'blo seems to always \"get 'er done\" and usually comes out with only a few scratches on his arms (from crashing through cypress trees). An international bubblegum champion extraordinaire, Ram-blo recently and secretively SAVED THE ENTIRE FREAKIN' UNIVERSE by assuming Kernel Troutman's identity (with beret), locating the secret Russian micro-film, and destroying an entire village's goldfish pond in the process; hurling 374 RPG blasts, 112 knife slashes and 8 packs of bubblegum. \"Well, yo,\" said Ram-blo after the mission.","opts":[{"name":"Default","sold":true}],"files":["img/094-1.webp","img/094-2.webp","img/094-3.webp","img/094-4.webp"]}];